sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Feature
    participant API as Analytics (one API)
    participant Pipe as EventPipeline
    participant Buf as Durable buffer (Ch 31/3)
    participant Sink as AnalyticsSink (vendor)

    User->>Feature: taps add-to-cart
    Feature->>API: track(AddToCart(productId))
    API->>Pipe: consent? (Ch 28)
    Pipe->>Pipe: redact PII + allowlist params (Ch 28)
    Pipe->>Buf: enqueue (immediate, non-blocking, offline/death-safe)
    Note over Buf: event waits durably - NOT sent inline
    Buf->>Pipe: flush trigger (size/time/background, Ch 14/47)
    Pipe->>Sink: upload batch (WorkManager, unmetered pref, Ch 30/47)
    Sink-->>Pipe: ack -> remove from buffer (at-least-once + server dedup, Ch 15)
